  "bodyHash": "6pfLEVtCUqg=",
  "content": "<p>這個模組新增了流體儲存槽，可容納 4 桶（第 1 級）至多達 1048576 桶（最高級）的液體。</p><p>儲存槽可垂直堆疊組合。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://gist.github.com/Kotori316/8c426c7e1ea70856bf5f2545048c49a9/raw/aa04a21f3c5d2fec496dc73e3531b099ec33220c/2023-07-23_18.06.38.png\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-scala\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Scala</a>&nbsp;以及&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libblockattributes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lib Block Attributes</a>&nbsp;（1.18 版本前）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Forge 版本請參閱<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/largefluidtank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">支援原版桶裝流體、水瓶、藥水，以及 Tech Reborn 的細胞流體。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">合成配方請參閱&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Kotori316/FluidTank/wiki/Recipe\" rel=\"nofollow\">此頁面</a>&nbsp;或使用 REI 查看。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">1.20.1 版本需安裝&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scalable-cats-force/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scalable Cat's Force for fabric</a>&nbsp;作為此模組的依賴項。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">在 1.20.1 版本中，流體儲存槽<strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">不僅可注入流體，還能容納藥水</span></strong>！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://gist.github.com/Kotori316/8c426c7e1ea70856bf5f2545048c49a9/raw/aa04a21f3c5d2fec496dc73e3531b099ec33220c/2023-07-23_18.12.16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\"></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
